{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d9d14ec1786f5b2a346b22b91b066ecc4ece8ba003374cc76432b65ce8995ce4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ea7e177282af21cb60d4848b71337b8a2df7a99ea04ea3dd536711452d7ec5",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n在露营地拍摄的MV，听说已经完成了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d04ccda4033d697aa4d56a80e8294dc7ad37e010fe2638150f302ab9cdb58f2d",
      "text": "我觉得那次露营不仅让我作为偶像有所成长，\n也是一段让自己的心灵得到放松的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91c8f9cfa7a429c69887894e5ecf2d2cd9a731c95de511edbc0db5021eb59785",
      "text": "坦率地享受在露营地的时光，\n我想这一点也表现在了MV之中吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2617ed9de1aa44a4851e304b2bf3bbebc00b0f1b4165a8f044736fb458f3cab",
      "text": "感谢你将这份工作交托给我。\n谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e65436fd312affed145d076368850994e3142b246f15480c75900f3d6db1cf",
      "text": "MV里的神情\n广受好评哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9885dcd539d987839859aab7538eda07326a75f34788c0d014693443985d62a",
      "text": "这次的工作\n自然的状态正是其魅力所在",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd37607e789268edc41d71853c9f6fa23411e4db4b98ce951b491df2dd91a921",
      "text": "太好了。那也是多亏了阁下和大家\n营造出的融洽氛围。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0df80a2bccfafd272c0f0d70dd39ef3b0d45fbc44854170fee12d507d8b1c4b",
      "text": "那样就好。也就是说，我们展现出了\n大家所期待的内容呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1852069f41e1349b40d825c37773e6f5844e6e5c665abd638cf63c9f6cc02c50",
      "text": "虽然说是自然状态有些僭越，\n但我展现出了自身不一样的另一面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f5d3a1a36153af1feaff69fabea042c62b6fdfc5b62492c561b85ad5fcb484",
      "text": "我想以此经历为养分，\n去追求比以往更加丰富的表现力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_a:2_4_008_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feaf34290e1c4305220f64d2209c3dbb8bd7722406954d1a266b4b1d9f138637",
      "text": "很期待阁下接下来会为我带来怎样的工作。\n今后也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
